# wip249: a held step's p-lock moves the SLIDER on the screen (it used to draw the knob's own value, so the slider stayed
# still while the lock changed). FX page (MIX): K1 = the Mix slider. Shots: before the lock, after turning the lock.
wait 300
tapkey w0
tap FX
wait 100
shot lockslider_0.png
key w0 down
spin K1 40
wait 200
shot lockslider_1.png
expect sound0.0.13 0
key w0 up
wait 200
shot lockslider_2.png
